### 1. Create reservation
#### Request
POST {{url}}/reservations
Cookie: Authentication={{cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2024-07-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2024-07-10T00:00:00.000Z",
  "charge": {
    "amount": 5,
    "paymentMethodId": "pm_card_visa"
  }
}

### 2. Find reservation by id
#### Request
GET {{url}}/reservations/{{id}}
Cookie: Authentication={{cookie}}

### 3. Find all reservations
#### Request
GET {{url}}/reservations
Cookie: Authentication={{cookie}}

### 4. Update reservation
#### Request
PATCH {{url}}/reservations/{{id}}
Cookie: Authentication={{cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endDate": "2024-07-15T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 5. Delete reservation
#### Request
DELETE {{url}}/reservations/{{id}}
Cookie: Authentication={{cookie}}
